      "duration_s": 3,
      "narration": [
        "An AI agent isn't just a model. It's a model plus a harness."
      ],
      "data": {
        "title": "Agent = Model + Harness",
        "subtitle": "The model thinks. The harness lets it act.",
        "kicker": "From the Databricks blog"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "roles",
      "type": "flow",
      "role": "how",
      "duration_s": 8,
      "narration": [
        "The model is the brain: it reasons, and decides what to do.",
        "Alone, it can only answer. It can't run code, call tools, or remember earlier work.",
        "The harness is the body around it: it acts, keeps memory, and enforces rules."
      ],
