    {
      "id": "loop",
      "type": "cycle",
      "role": "how",
      "duration_s": 12,
      "narration": [
        "At its core, an agent is a loop.",
        "The post's example: a coding agent fixing a bug.",
        "Reason: the model proposes a code change.",
        "Act: the harness runs it in an isolated sandbox.",
        "Observe: the test results go back to the model.",
        "Then round again: the model works out what went wrong, and tries a new fix.",
        "That's the ReAct loop, for reasoning and acting.",
        "It repeats until the job is done."
      ],
      "data": {
        "title": "An agent is a loop",
        "nodes": [
