    {
      "id": "parts",
      "type": "cycle",
      "role": "how",
      "duration_s": 10,
      "narration": [
        "A harness is that loop, plus knobs to control it.",
        "The post lists eight building blocks.",
        "Instructions: a standing prompt with its rules.",
        "Tools: the actions it may take.",
        "A safe place to act: an isolated sandbox.",
        "Memory: files that last between sessions.",
        "And old context, summarized to fit.",
        "Checks: tests after each action, approval before risky steps, and logs."
      ],
      "data": {
        "title": "A harness is the loop, plus knobs",
